{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/eb662cce5fb4104d6737ace2a88aa25d.avif?t=1759440610\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity Mask</strong> is a stylized third-person action-adventure that blends fast-paced combat, platforming, puzzle-solving, and rich storytelling in a world shaped by Norse mythology. Set after the fall of Ragnar\u00f6k, the game invites players into a broken yet mysterious world\u2014full of secrets, ancient ruins, and mechanical remnants of lost civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.poster.avif?t=1759440610\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.webm?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.mp4?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Embla</strong>, an <strong>Andromen</strong>\u2014a hybrid being born from machine and human soul. Awakened without memories, you must explore vast biomes, uncover hidden temples, and reconstruct a forgotten past to understand the power of the Infinity Mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.poster.avif?t=1759440610\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.webm?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.mp4?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694 Melee &amp; Ranged Combat</strong>: Mix precise sword attacks with elemental crossbow bolts. Use your shield, chain combos, and unleash special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Unique Gadgets &amp; Movement</strong>: Equip powerful tools like the Grappling Hook, Gravity Glove, Wingsuit, and more to traverse the world and solve complex puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/88fee8c13e16137ed254957f2af7889a.poster.avif?t=1759440610\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/88fee8c13e16137ed254957f2af7889a.webm?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/88fee8c13e16137ed254957f2af7889a.mp4?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Ancient Dungeons &amp; Challenges</strong>: Unlock the secrets of long-forgotten temples with clever puzzles, pressure-based mechanisms, and interactive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Handcrafted Biomes</strong>: Travel through lush jungles, icy mountains, scorched deserts, and ruined cities\u2014each with its own story and visual identity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.poster.avif?t=1759440610\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.webm?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.mp4?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Character &amp; World Progression</strong>: Upgrade your skill tree, uncover hidden data logs, and piece together the mystery of Embla\u2019s origin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric Sound &amp; Story</strong>: Dive into a rich narrative with stylized visuals and an emotional soundtrack inspired by Norse sagas and futuristic ruins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.poster.avif?t=1759440610\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.webm?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.mp4?t=1759440610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/33729